  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Each rung owns its level on its 1H record. The 2H record takes `Stats` from its rung's 1H record (`2H02` from `1H02`, `2H03` from `1H03`), but the Magic record (`DLC2EncAshSpawnMagic0N`) uses it without `Stats` and keeps its own level: a rung change has to be made on its 1H and Magic records both.",
      "`DLC2EncAshSpawn1H02` uses `1H01` as its template without `Stats`; `1H03` has no template.",
      "The two Raven Rock rows keep their own PC×0.75 [25–50] level whatever the list draws.",
      "Every other Ash Spawn record (every `DLC2LvlAshSpawn*` wrapper, and the summon `DLC2SummonAshSpawn01` on *Undead Summons*, which follows `1H01`) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
